== Research interests

- Distributed computing and distributed learning
- Machine learning and deep reinforcement learning for networks
- Wireless and mobile networking, and the Internet of Things
- Semantic communication and edge intelligence
- Content caching, adaptive bit-rate streaming, and multipath congestion control
- Network optimization, game theory, and network utility maximization

== Education

- *Ph.D.* in Computer Engineering, Kyung Hee University, Seoul, Korea, 2009--2014.
- *M.Sc.* in Telecommunication, Ho Chi Minh City University of Technology, Vietnam,
  1999--2003.

== Academic and professional appointments

- *Associate Professor*, School of Computer Science and Engineering, International University
  (VNU-HCM), currently.
- *Head of the IT Department*, School of Computer Science and Engineering, International
  University (VNU-HCM).
- *Researcher*, School of Computer Science and Engineering, International University (VNU-HCM),
  2007 to present.
- *Industry positions*, 1998--2007.

== Teaching

- *Undergraduate*: Computer Networks; Introduction to Wireless Networks; Optimization;
  Introduction to Computing; C/C++ Programming.
- *Graduate*: Algorithm Optimization; Mobile and Wireless Networks.

== Professional service

- Reviewer for /Computer Networks/, /Computer Science Review/, /Mobile Networks and
